/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:106:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:107:Crop off the control row and column, then cyclically roll the payload by the two marker offsets.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:108:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:109:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:110:- The grid is square, with a control row on top and a control column on the left.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:111:- The control row and column share one filler color and one single-pixel marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:112:- The lower-right square is the payload and contains none of the control colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:113:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:114:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:115:- Remove the top control row and left control column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:116:- Roll the remaining payload down by the marker's zero-based position in the left control column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:117:- Roll the payload right by the marker's zero-based position in the top control row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:118:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:119:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:120:- The two border markers are cyclic shift amounts for the payload, not colors to preserve.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:121:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:122:</reference_puzzle>
