/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:312:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:313:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:314:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:315:- The two foreground colors are a frequent trail color and a rarer marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:316:- All marker pixels lie nearest to one grid edge, and that edge contains trail-color runs that define the source-band thickness.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:317:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:318:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:319:- Choose the source edge identified by the marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:320:- A row or column perpendicular to that edge moves if its source-band slice contains the trail color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:321:- Copy that slice unchanged to the opposite edge, erase the remaining trail cells to background, and keep marker-only lines fixed.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:322:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:323:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:324:- The marker color identifies the active edge, while the trail color identifies which parallel rows or columns carry an edge-band slice across the grid.
