/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:331:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:332:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:333:- The scene uses black outside space, yellow fill, gray one-cell-thick bars, and solid orange rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:334:- Each gray bar 4-touches exactly one orange rectangle; some orange rectangles have no touching gray bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:335:- Gray bars touching the same orange rectangle all have the same orientation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:336:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:337:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:338:- Recolor every original gray cell to yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:339:- For each orange rectangle touched by gray bars, count the gray cells assigned to that rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:340:- Horizontal gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange rows starting from the contacted top or bottom row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:341:- Vertical gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange columns starting from the contacted left or right column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:342:- Orange rectangles with no touching gray bar remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:343:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:344:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:345:- The gray pixels are not copied by shape; their count is transferred into the neighboring orange rectangle as edge-aligned row or column stripes.
