/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:368:Fill rectangles between diagonal marker pairs using a color legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:369:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:370:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:371:- bg grid with a vertical legend at the bottom-left: each row is a (marker_color, fill_color) pair.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:372:- Scattered L-shaped corner markers of each marker color define opposite corners of axis-aligned rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:373:- Some markers are solid 2×2 blocks instead of corner pairs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:374:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:375:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:376:- Read legend bottom-to-top; for each entry find all pixels of that marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:377:- Determine which two bbox corners carry L-shaped anchors — the *other* diagonal defines the fill region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:378:- Fill the diamond (all shortest-path cells between those two corners) with the legend's fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:379:- Solid 2×2 marker blocks are simply recolored to the fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:380:- Later legend entries are protected from earlier fills.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:381:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed241687935/5/prompt.md:382:Key insight: The L-shaped anchors sit on the marker diagonal; the fill goes on the opposite diagonal of the bounding box.
